# Platform — Lead Form (M20-S01): LeadFormConfig aggregate + consolidated admin config endpoint
# UC-037: Manager configures the lead form module
# UC-041 (Trigger): status endpoint powers the dashboard's gated "Leads" nav item
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl = {{backendUrl}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get current lead form config (default shape for a tenant with no row yet)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER

###

### Consolidated save — teaser + audienceMode + questions in one atomic request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fale com a gente",
  "ctaLabel": "Preencher formulário",
  "audienceMode": "GUEST_AND_CUSTOMER",
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000101",
      "label": "Qual serviço te interessa?",
      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "required": true,
      "options": ["Lavagem simples", "Lavagem completa", "Enceramento"],
      "order": 0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Status — nav-gating read (STAFF can also read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/status
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{staffId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FAILURE PATHS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### STAFF forbidden from editing config → 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{staffId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: STAFF
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fale com a gente"
}

###

