###

### Choice question with only 1 option → 400 PLATFORM_LEAD_FORM_QUESTION_OPTIONS_INVALID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000101",
      "label": "Qual serviço te interessa?",
      "type": "SINGLE_CHOICE",
      "required": true,
      "options": ["Lavagem simples"],
      "order": 0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Empty question label → 400 GENERIC_FIELD_REQUIRED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/lead-form/config
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    { "id": "01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000101", "label": "", "type": "TEXT", "required": false, "order": 0 }
  ]
}
